 "level_notes": {
  "0": "luau-lang/luau is the single implementation: Ast/ (lexer, parser), Analysis/ (type checker; old TypeInfer and new constraint solver), Compiler/ (bytecode), VM/ (interpreter derived from Lua 5.1) and CodeGen/ (native code).",
  "1": "luau.org documents the syntax extensions over Lua 5.1, the type system, grammar and library; language changes are made through luau-lang/rfcs. The Lua 5.1 manual remains the base definition."
 },
